add('xhhl',11,'Qonda indlela isibhengezo esicenga ngayo','Ukufunda nokubukela: ukuqaphela ukusetyenziswa kolwimi',
'Chonga injongo nabaphulaphuli|Cacisa ulwimi olucengayo|Yahlula ibango kubungqina',
'Isibhengezo esicengayo sifuna ukutshintsha indlela abantu abacinga okanye abenza ngayo. Buza ukuba sithetha nabani kwaye sifuna benze ntoni.|Amagama aquka wonke umntu anokwakha imvakalelo yobunye. Amagama achukumisa iimvakalelo anokwenza abantu baxhalabe okanye babe nethemba.|Ibango alilingani nobungqina. Vavanya ukuba kukho ulwazi oluthembekileyo oluxhasa oko kuthethwayo.',
('Isibhengezo sokuqala: “Masikhusele ithala lethu leencwadi. Yiza nencwadi ngoMgqibelo. Incwadi enye ivula iingcango ezininzi.”',['Ibinzana','Indlela','Isiphumo esinokwenzeka'],[['lethu','ukuquka abafundi','imvakalelo yobunye'],['masikhusele','isicelo sokuthatha inyathelo','uxanduva oludibeneyo'],['iingcango ezininzi','ulwimi olufuziselayo','amathuba amaninzi']]),
'Sicenga njani esi sibhengezo abantu ukuba bathathe inxaxheba?',
'Igama elithi “lethu” libandakanya abantu kwithala leencwadi labo.|Ibinzana elithi “masikhusele” libiza abantu ukuba basebenze kunye.|“Iingcango ezininzi” limela amathuba okufunda; alithethi iingcango zesakhiwo kuphela.',
'Yintoni ekufuneka abantu beze nayo?|Ngaba “iingcango ezininzi” libalo eliqinisekisiweyo? Cacisa.|Loluphi ulwazi olusebenzisekayo olungekhoyo?',
'Incwadi.|Hayi. Eli libinzana elifuziselayo elithetha amathuba.|Umzekelo: indawo, ixesha elichanekileyo okanye iinkcukacha zoqhagamshelwano.',
'Ungachongi nje ubuchule bolwimi. Cacisa indlela obusebenza ngayo kwesi sibhengezo.')
add('xhhl',12,'Yakha umhlathi wohlalutyo loncwadi','Ukufunda nokubukela: uncwadi; ukubhala nokunikezela',
'Beka uluvo olucacileyo|Khetha ubungqina obufanelekileyo|Cacisa umfanekiso-ngqondweni',
'Umhlathi wohlalutyo kufuneka ube noluvo, ubungqina kunye nengcaciso. Isicatshulwa masixhase into oyithethayo.|Ukucaphula kuphela akwanelanga. Cacisa intsingiselo yamagama nendlela anxulumana ngayo noluvo lwakho.|Lo mbongo wokuqala ngowokuziqhelanisa. Awuthathi indawo yeencwadi okanye imibongo emiselwe sisikolo sakho.',
('Umbongo wokuqala: “Ndiyasonga imephu. / Indlela isavulekile. / Ngaphaya kwesango / kusasa kundilindile.”',['Umfanekiso','Intsingiselo enokwenzeka','Indlela exhaswa ngayo'],[['imephu iyasongwa','ukulungiselela kuyaphela','isenzo sesithethi'],['indlela ivulekile','amathuba asekhona','uhambo alukapheli'],['kusasa kuyalinda','ithemba ngekamva','isimntwiso']]),
'Cacisa indlela lo mbongo obonisa ngayo ukuqala kohambo.',
'Uluvo: isithethi sijonge amathuba angaphambili nangona isiphelo singaziwa.|Ukusongwa kwemephu kubonisa ukuphela kokulungiselela, kodwa indlela isavulekile.|Ukusa okulindileyo kunika ikamva isenzo somntu. Oku kudala ithemba, kungathembisi impumelelo eqinisekileyo.',
'Chonga umzekelo wesimntwiso.|Yahlula isithethi kumbhali.|Ngaba lo mbongo uqinisekisa impumelelo? Xhasa impendulo.',
'“Kusasa kundilindile.”|Isithethi lilizwi elithetha kumbongo; asisoloko singumbhali uqobo.|Hayi. Ubonisa ithuba lokuqala kodwa akasiniki isiphelo sohambo.',
'Ingcaciso eyahlukileyo inokwamkeleka xa ixhaswa kakuhle bubungqina bombongo.')
add('zuhl',10,'Ukufunda ngokuqondisisa','Ukufunda nokubukela: ukuqondisisa; ulimi engqikithini',
'Thola ulwazi olushiwo ngqo|Yenza isiphetho esisekelwe ebufakazini|Chaza ukukhethwa kwamagama',
'Imibuzo eqondile ifuna ulwazi olubhalwe ngokusobala. Isiphetho sidinga umkhondo ovela esiqeshini kanye nencazelo enengqondo.|Uma ucaphuna, khetha amagama ambalwa afanele. Chaza ukuthi ahlobana kanjani nempendulo yakho.|Ungaqambi izehlakalo ezingekho esiqeshini. Hlukanisa esikwaziyo kulokho esicabanga ukuthi kungenzeka.',
('Kusukela egameni kuya emqondweni',['Igama','Elikukhombisayo','Ubufakazi'],[['futhi','isenzo siyaphindwa','wayeseke wabheka'],['ekugcineni','ukulinda kuyaphela','ibhasi liyafika'],['wamamatheka','injabulo noma ukukhululeka','indlela asabela ngayo']]),
'Isiqeshana sokuqala: “UNomsa wabheka umgwaqo futhi. Ekugcineni lafika ibhasi. Wamamatheka wathatha isikhwama sakhe.” Yini ekhombisa ukuthi ubelindile?',
'Igama elithi “futhi” likhombisa ukuthi uNomsa wayeseke wabheka umgwaqo.|“Ekugcineni” likhombisa ukuphela kokulinda.|Ukumamatheka kwakhe lapho ibhasi lifika kusekela umqondo wenjabulo noma wokukhululeka.',
'Yini eyafikayo?|Yiliphi igama elikhombisa ukuphindwa kwesenzo?|Siyazi yini ukuthi uNomsa uyaphi? Sekela impendulo.',
'Yibhasi.|“Futhi”.|Cha. Isiqeshana asiyisho indawo aya kuyo.',
'Isiphetho asiyona indaba entsha. Kufanele sisekelwe emagameni esiqeshana.')
add('zuhl',11,'Hlaziya ulimi lokunxenxa','Ukufunda nokubukela: ukuqaphela ukusetshenziswa kolimi',
'Thola inhloso nezethameli|Chaza indlela yokunxenxa|Hlukanisa isimangalo ebufakazini',
'Umbhalo onxenxayo uzama ukuthonya indlela abantu abacabanga noma abenza ngayo. Buza ukuthi ukhuluma nobani nokuthi ufuna benzeni.|Amagama afaka wonke umuntu angakha ubunye. Ulimi oluthinta imizwa lungadala ukukhathazeka noma ithemba.|Isimangalo asibona ubufakazi ngokwaso. Bheka ukuthi kukhona yini ulwazi oluthembekile olusisekelayo.',
('Isikhangiso sokuqala: “Masivikele umtapo wethu wezincwadi. Letha incwadi ngoMgqibelo. Incwadi eyodwa ivula iminyango eminingi.”',['Ibinzana','Indlela','Umphumela ongaba khona'],[['wethu','ukufaka wonke umuntu','umuzwa wobunye'],['masivikele','ukubiza abantu esenzweni','ukuzibophezela'],['iminyango eminingi','ulimi olungokomfanekiso','amathuba amaningi']]),
'Lesi sikhangiso sibanxenxa kanjani abantu ukuba babambe iqhaza?',
'Igama elithi “wethu” lifaka abafundi emphakathini womtapo wezincwadi.|“Masivikele” licela isenzo esihlanganyelwe.|“Iminyango eminingi” imele amathuba okufunda; ayisho iminyango yesakhiwo kuphela.',
'Yini okufanele abantu bayilethe?|Ingabe “iminyango eminingi” iyisibalo esiqinisekisiwe? Chaza.|Yiluphi ulwazi olusebenzisekayo olungekho?',
'Incwadi.|Cha. Kuyinkulumo engokomfanekiso emele amathuba.|Isibonelo: indawo, isikhathi esiqondile noma imininingwane yokuxhumana.',
'Ukusho igama lesu lokunxenxa kuphela akwanele; chaza ukuthi lisebenza kanjani kulo mbhalo.')
add('zuhl',12,'Bhala isigaba sokuhlaziya izinkondlo','Ukufunda nokubukela: imibhalo yobuciko; ukubhala nokwethula',
'Veza umbono ocacile|Sebenzisa ubufakazi bombhalo|Chaza isithombe nomqondo',
'Isigaba sokuhlaziya sidinga umbono, ubufakazi kanye nencazelo. Khetha ubufakazi obuhambisana nombono wakho.|Ukucaphuna akuthathi indawo yencazelo. Chaza ukuthi amagama noma izithombe zakha kanjani umqondo.|Le nkondlo yokuqala ingeyokuzijwayeza. Ayithathi indawo yezincwadi nezinkondlo ezimiswe yisikole sakho.',
('Inkondlo yokuqala: “Ngigoqa ibalazwe. / Indlela isavulekile. / Ngale kwesango / ukusa kungilindile.”',['Isithombe','Umqondo ongaba khona','Ubufakazi'],[['ibalazwe liyagoqwa','ukulungiselela kuyaphela','isenzo sesikhulumi'],['indlela ivulekile','amathuba asekhona','uhambo lusengaphambili'],['ukusa kuyalinda','ithemba ngekusasa','ukwenzasamuntu']]),
'Chaza ukuthi inkondlo iveza kanjani ukuqala kohambo.',
'Umbono: isikhulumi sibona ithuba lokuqala, nakuba umphumela ungaziwa.|Ukugoqa ibalazwe kuqeda ukulungiselela, kodwa indlela ihlala ivulekile.|Ukusa okulindile kunikezwa isenzo somuntu; lokhu kwakha ithemba ngaphandle kokuqinisekisa impumelelo.',
'Thola isibonelo sokwenzasamuntu.|Hlukanisa isikhulumi nembongi.|Ingabe inkondlo iqinisekisa impumelelo? Sekela impendulo.',
'“Ukusa kungilindile.”|Isikhulumi yizwi elikhuluma enkondlweni; asihlali siyimbongi uqobo.|Cha. Inkondlo iveza amathuba kodwa ayisiniki isiphetho sohambo.',
'Umbono ohlukile ungamukeleka uma usekelwa kahle ubufakazi obusembhalweni.')
add('lo',10,'Set a goal you can act on','Development of the self in society: self-awareness and goal setting',
'Turn an aspiration into an action|Identify support and constraints|Review progress without self-judgement',
'A useful goal names a specific action and a realistic time frame. Link it to something you value rather than comparing yourself constantly with others.|Planning includes barriers such as transport, data, responsibilities and access to a quiet space. Choose supports that fit your situation.|Review what happened, identify an obstacle and adjust the plan. Reflection is evidence for a better next step, not proof of your worth as a person.',
('From aspiration to a weekly action',['Stage','Example','Check'],[['Aspiration','improve maths confidence','why it matters'],['Action','practise three factorising questions on Tue/Thu','time and place'],['Review','check answers on Friday','identify one error to discuss']]),
'A learner wants to “do better” but has limited data. Turn this into a workable one-week plan.',
'Choose a small topic and download or print questions when Wi-Fi is available.|Set two short practice sessions and a Friday answer check, allowing for other responsibilities.|Ask a tutor or teacher about one specific error; adjust next week’s plan using the result.',
'Rewrite “I will study everything tomorrow” as a realistic action.|Name one support besides paid tutoring.|What should you do if the first plan was unrealistic?',
'For example: complete three algebra questions after school on Tuesday and check them on Wednesday.|A teacher, peer study group, school library or trusted adult.|Identify the barrier, reduce or reschedule the action and review again.',
'A plan is not effective merely because it is ambitious. It needs feasible actions, support and a way to review progress.')
add('lo',11,'Make an informed study-path decision','Careers and career choices: requirements and opportunities',
'Connect interests with possible study paths|Compare entry requirements responsibly|Build an evidence-based next-step plan',
'A career decision combines interests, strengths, values, subject choices and practical constraints. One test or mark should not define your whole future.|Entry requirements differ by institution, programme and year. Check official sources for subject requirements, selection rules and deadlines.|Meeting minimum requirements does not guarantee admission. Keep alternative pathways and investigate funding, accommodation and support.',
('A comparison sheet to complete using official sources',['Check','Option A','Option B'],[['Required subjects','record official details','record official details'],['Selection and deadline','save source and date','save source and date'],['Cost and support','tuition, travel, funding','tuition, travel, funding']]),
'A learner enjoys science but has not checked programme requirements. What should they do before applying?',
'List two suitable programmes and identify each institution’s official admissions page.|Record required subjects, marks, selection steps and the current application deadline with the date checked.|Compare affordability and support, prepare documents and keep a realistic alternative pathway.',
'Why are social-media posts insufficient as the only admissions source?|Distinguish eligibility from acceptance.|Name two costs besides tuition to investigate.',
'Posts may be outdated, incomplete or unofficial; verify using the institution.|Eligibility meets stated entry conditions; acceptance is the institution’s actual offer after selection.|For example accommodation, transport, data, books or meals.',
'Do not publish or reuse an old deadline as current. Always verify the programme and year directly.')
add('lo',12,'Prepare for assessments sustainably','Study skills: examination preparation and stress management',
'Use retrieval practice and feedback|Create a realistic revision cycle|Recognise when support is needed',
'Retrieval practice means trying to recall or apply knowledge before checking notes. Checking errors afterwards helps choose the next revision task.|A balanced revision plan rotates subjects, includes breaks and protects sleep. Long hours alone do not prove that learning has occurred.|Stress can affect concentration. Use practical supports and talk to a trusted adult or qualified professional when distress is persistent or interferes with daily life.',
('A repeatable revision cycle',['Step','Action','Evidence'],[['Recall','answer a short set without notes','your first attempt'],['Check','compare with a memo','identify the error type'],['Repair','rework and explain the correction','correct reasoning'],['Revisit','try again after a gap','independent recall']]),
'A learner rereads notes for hours but struggles with questions. Suggest a stronger revision session.',
'Choose a short topic and attempt a few questions before looking at the notes.|Mark the attempt, classify errors as concept, calculation or interpretation, and explain one correction.|Return to a similar question after a gap and ask for help if the concept remains unclear.',
'Why is copying a memo not enough evidence of learning?|Name one adjustment that can reduce revision overload.|How can a learner use a teacher’s feedback?',
'It does not show that the learner can recall or apply the reasoning independently.|Reduce session length, prioritise a specific topic, schedule breaks or seek help planning.|Identify a specific recurring error, practise the relevant skill and check the improvement.',
'Peer advice and study plans do not replace professional support for persistent distress or significant health concerns.')
